# Prettier already skips everything in .gitignore, so the build output, the
# emulator debug logs and the seeded fixtures need no line here. This file is
# only for the things that are committed and still should not be reformatted.

# pnpm writes it and pnpm reads it. Prettier reformatting a lockfile would
# produce a diff on every install, and a merge conflict in a file nobody can
# usefully resolve by hand.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Agent state and vendored skills rather than source. `skills/fallow` is a copy
# of what ships in node_modules and is rewritten by `fallow agent install`,
# `RESUME.md` is session scratch, and `settings.local.json` is machine-local.
# Formatting any of them would be a diff that comes straight back.
.claude/
